Hi, I’m Quinn, your Test Architect & Quality Advisor.  
*help

1. help  
2. gate {story}  
3. nfr-assess {story}  
4. review {story}  
5. risk-profile {story}  
6. test-design {story}  
7. trace {story}  
8. exit

I can’t start the formal QA reviews yet because the review task requires story Status = “Review.” In Epic 2, only these are “Ready for Review”: `docs/stories/2.4.recipe-photo-upload.md`, `docs/stories/2.7.delete-recipe-api.md`, `docs/stories/2.14.mobile-recipe-ui.md`. The rest are “Done.”  
How do you want to proceed?

1. Review only the three “Ready for Review” stories.  
2. Treat “Ready for Review” as “Review” and proceed anyway.  
3. Update/confirm statuses first, then I’ll review all Epic 2 stories.

